      "everything_you_need_to_adopt_this_tool": "Everything you need to adopt this tool in a Psychology, Education, School Psychology, or Industrial/Organizational Psych course. The content is built for undergraduate and graduate teaching; pick what fits your level.",
      "glossary_2": "📖 Glossary",
      "key_terms_used_throughout_the_assessme": "Key terms used throughout the Assessment Literacy Lab. Type in the box to filter by term, definition, or module. Terms link conceptually to the module where they're developed most fully.",
