      "mercury_venus_mars_jupiter_and_saturn_": "Mercury, Venus, Mars, Jupiter, and Saturn can all be visible to the naked eye depending on the date. ",
      "venus_is_the_brightest_often_the_morni": "Venus is the brightest — often the \"morning star\" before dawn or \"evening star\" after sunset. ",
