      "too_much_advance_high_compression_spon": "Too much advance + high compression → spontaneous detonation. Engine damage.",
      "misfire": "⚠️ Misfire",
      "insufficient_timing_or_excessive_overl": "Insufficient timing or excessive overlap → unstable combustion.",
