      "deformed_wing_virus": "Deformed Wing Virus",
      "workers_are_emerging_with_shriveled_us": "Workers are emerging with shriveled, useless wings — classic signs of DWV. This virus is transmitted by varroa mites and is the #1 driver of colony collapse worldwide.",
      "plant_wildflowers": "Plant Wildflowers",
