      "sunflower": "Sunflower",
      "massive_composite_flower_heads_are_pol": "Massive composite flower heads are pollen landing pads. Choose pollen-producing (not pollen-free) cultivars.",
      "buckwheat": "Buckwheat",
      "dark_molasses_like_honey_blooms_30_day": "Dark, molasses-like honey. Blooms 30 days after sowing — easy late-summer flow plant.",
