      "in_small_groups_students_practice_the_": "In small groups, students practice the mimic octopus poses: lionfish, sea snake, flatfish, jellyfish. Capture in photos or video.",
      "origami_nautilus": "Origami nautilus",
      "fold_an_origami_nautilus_label_its_par": "Fold an origami nautilus + label its parts. Include the chambered shell + siphuncle + tentacles. Mount + display.",
      "cephalopod_sticker_design": "Cephalopod sticker design",
      "design_5_cephalopod_themed_stickers_us": "Design 5 cephalopod-themed stickers using Canva, Adobe, or similar. Include accurate biology. Share with classmates or use for unit-completion incentives.",
      "cephalopod_evolution_timeline_mural": "Cephalopod evolution timeline mural",
      "create_a_class_wide_mural_showing_500_": "Create a class-wide mural showing 500 MY of cephalopod evolution. Each student illustrates one major event from the Timeline tab.",
