      "sew_a_stuffed_cephalopod_with_anatomic": "Sew a stuffed cephalopod with anatomically accurate features. Include 8 arms with suckers, mantle, eyes, siphon, beak. Display with biology labels.",
      "cephalopod_inspired_song_or_poem": "Cephalopod-inspired song or poem",
