      "wcag_2_1_aa_changes_apply_on_next_dive": "WCAG 2.1 AA. Changes apply on next Dive. Captions mirror every audio cue (predator alerts, hunt success, ink, achievements). Reduced motion dims animation amplitudes. All settings persist on this device only — no cloud, no FERPA surface.",
      "3d_engine_webgl_failed_to_load_or_init": "⚠ 3D engine / WebGL failed to load or initialize. WebGL might be disabled or unsupported.",
      "retry": "Retry",
      "3d_octopus_hunt_simulator_wasd_to_craw": "3D octopus hunt simulator. WASD to crawl, A and D rotate. Space jets. Click hunts. I uses ink defense. G grabs shelters.",
      "end_run_surface": "◀ End run + surface",
