      "a_sea_otter_dives_down_through_the_kel": "A sea otter dives down through the kelp",
      "otters_are_persistent_intelligent_it_a": "Otters are persistent + intelligent. It already knows there's octopus in this area. It will dive repeatedly + use its hands to pry open hiding spots.",
      "ink_jet_away": "🌫️ Ink + jet away",
      "crawl_into_a_deep_crevice": "🕳️ Crawl into a deep crevice",
      "dolphin_pod_overhead_echolocation_ping": "Dolphin pod overhead — echolocation pinging closer",
      "active_sonar_means_ink_is_useless_camo": "Active sonar means ink is useless. Camouflage is useless. They know exactly where you are.",
      "dive_deep_break_their_depth_limit": "⬇️ Dive deep — break their depth limit",
      "jet_sideways_at_speed": "🚀 Jet sideways at speed",
      "a_sperm_whale_s_sonar_pings_the_deep": "A sperm whale's sonar pings the deep",
      "sperm_whales_dive_to_2000m_to_hunt_gia": "Sperm whales dive to 2000m to hunt giant + colossal squid. Their sonar penetrates the dark + the depth + the ink. This is the apex threat your species faces.",
      "descend_even_deeper": "⬇️ Descend even deeper",
