      "saved_notice_nobody_checked_your_answe": "✓ Saved. Notice — nobody checked your answer. That is what learner-driven inquiry looks like.",
      "design_note_no_death_toll_counter_no_p": "Design note: no death-toll counter, no peak-infection chart, no quiz validation. Outcome is shown as a discrete 3-regime marker (contained / emerging / pandemic), not a continuous indicator — by design, to discourage optimization-gaming behavior. The point is the inquiry, not the number.",
