      "measuring_cups": "Measuring cups",
      "a_standard_set_includes_1_cup_1_2_1_3_": "A standard set includes 1 cup, 1/2, 1/3, 1/4. Some sets add 2/3 and 3/4. Glass measuring cups have markings for 1/4, 1/3, 1/2, 2/3, 3/4 cup and 1 cup.",
