      "napier_s_logarithms": "Napier's Logarithms",
      "john_napier_publishes_the_first_table_": "John Napier publishes the first table of logarithms. Lets multiplication become addition.",
      "oughtred_s_slide_rule": "Oughtred's Slide Rule",
      "william_oughtred_slides_two_log_scales": "William Oughtred slides two log scales past each other. The slide rule becomes the calculator for the next 350 years.",
      "carl_gauss_age_8": "Carl Gauss, age 8",
      "famously_sums_1_through_100_in_seconds": "Famously sums 1 through 100 in seconds by pairing 1+100, 2+99, ..., 50+51 — fifty pairs of 101 = 5050. The story may be apocryphal but the method is real.",
      "maria_montessori_is_born": "Maria Montessori is born",
