      "hilaire_belloc_pattern_blocks": "Hilaire Belloc & Pattern Blocks",
      "european_primary_classrooms_begin_usin": "European primary classrooms begin using wooden geometric tiles for tessellation work. Pattern blocks as standardized today come later (1960s, ESS curriculum).",
      "cuisenaire_rods": "Cuisenaire Rods",
