      "gattegno_also_popularizes_the_geoboard": "Gattegno also popularizes the geoboard: a peg grid for stretching rubber bands into polygons. Brings discrete geometry into reach for young children.",
      "jerome_bruner_cra_theory": "Jerome Bruner — CRA Theory",
      "toward_a_theory_of_instruction_bruner_": "\"Toward a Theory of Instruction.\" Bruner argues for enactive → iconic → symbolic progression — what U.S. classrooms call Concrete-Representational-Abstract.",
