      "common_core_state_standards": "Common Core State Standards",
      "u_s_ccss_m_adopted_in_most_states_expl": "U.S. CCSS-M adopted in most states. Explicitly names \"concrete models\" and \"manipulatives\" for K-5 — pulling the methods of Montessori, Cuisenaire, and Singapore into the national standards.",
