      "liber_abaci_in_detail": "Liber Abaci (in detail)",
      "fibonacci_s_book_includes_a_problem_ab": "Fibonacci's book includes a problem about rabbit reproduction that produces the Fibonacci sequence: 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13... These same numbers appear in nature and in pattern-block tilings.",
