      "lab_safety": "Lab safety: ",
      "wash_hands_before_and_after_every_micr": "Wash hands before AND after every microbiology activity. Wear closed-toe shoes. No eating or drinking. Treat all cultures as if pathogenic. Autoclave or bleach all materials before disposal. Tell a teacher immediately if you cut yourself or get a spill.",
