      "supersaw_stacks_multiple_sawtooth_osci": "SuperSaw stacks multiple sawtooth oscillators slightly detuned from each other. This creates a huge, wide, shimmering sound — the signature of EDM, trance, and modern pop. More voices = thicker sound but uses more CPU. Detuning controls how far apart the voices are tuned — more detune = wider/more chorus-like, less = tighter/more focused.",
