      "hotspots_are_stationary_heat_sources_i": "Hotspots are stationary heat sources in the mantle. As plates drift over them, they leave volcanic chains: the Hawaiian-Emperor track, the Yellowstone track. 40 hotspots catalogued.",
      "rock_catalog": "Rock Catalog",
