      "a_1500_printer_chose_blackletter_for_a": "A 1500 printer chose Blackletter for a Bible to signal sacred weight, Garamond for a Renaissance philosopher to signal humanist clarity, italic for a pocket book to fit more text per page. Every typeface choice was a claim about what the text was for.",
