      "a_compositor_combined_craft_mirror_rea": "A compositor combined craft (mirror-reading, fine motor work) with aesthetics (layout, spacing, type choice). That blend is still its own family of careers.",
      "graphic_designer_typographer": "Graphic designer / typographer",
