      "new_world_vultures_turkey_black_condor": "New World vultures (turkey, black, condor) hunt + soar like raptors but they're not in the raptor families Accipitriformes (hawks, eagles, kites) or Falconiformes (falcons). DNA evidence in the early 2000s placed them in their own order — ",
