      "raise_the_seat_until_your_eyes_are_lev": "Raise the seat until your EYES are level with the TOP of the steering wheel — you should see over it, not through it. Tilt the backrest slightly back (100-110° from vertical). Your back should touch the seat from tailbone to shoulders.",
      "eye_level": "eye level",
