      "dooring_kills_cyclists": "Dooring kills cyclists",
      "before_opening_your_door_in_traffic_us": "Before opening your door in traffic, use your FAR hand — your right hand from the driver seat in the U.S. — so your body naturally turns to check behind. Dooring injuries are 50% of urban cyclist crashes.",
