      "turning_across": "Turning across",
      "the_1_driver_vs_cyclist_crash_is_the_r": "The #1 driver-vs-cyclist crash is the RIGHT HOOK: driver turns right across a cyclist going straight in a bike lane. Before any right turn, shoulder-check for cyclists. Before left turns, scan for oncoming motorcycles.",
      "wet_roads": "Wet roads",
