      "healthy_vibrato_5_7_hz_oscillation_60_": "Healthy vibrato: 5–7 Hz oscillation, ~60–100 cents wide. Slower = wobble; faster = tremor. Vibrato is a function of relaxed breath support, not a separate technique.",
