      "range_formula": "Range formula: ",
      "for_a_takeoff_at_speed_v_and_angle_pro": "For a takeoff at speed v and angle θ, projectile range = v² × sin(2θ) / g. Maximum range at θ = 45°. Steeper angle gives more height; shallower gives more distance per unit speed.",
