      "narrate_init_first": "Wave Simulator loaded. An underwater ocean scene shows animated waves. Adjust amplitude and frequency with sliders. Switch between Free Wave, Standing, Ripple Tank, Longitudinal, Doppler, and Spectrum modes.",
