      "arc_burns_the_retina_in_seconds_galvan": "Arc burns the retina in seconds. Galvanized fumes cause \"zinc fume fever.\" Stainless fumes are a known carcinogen (hexavalent chromium). Hot-work sparks travel 30+ feet and smolder for hours. Every PPE rule below has a body count behind it.",
